<title>USA: Stage unit extends tender for notes.</title>
<headline>Stage unit extends tender for notes.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stage Stores Inc said Friday that its wholly-owned subsidiary, Specialty Retailers Inc, has extended the expiration date of its previously announced offers to repurchase certain notes.</p>
<p>The company said the expiration date for its outstanding 10 percent senior notes due 2000, 11 percent Series B senior subordinated notes due 2003 and 11 percent Series D senior subordinated notes due 2003 has been extended through June 13, unless further extended.</p>
</text>
